  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions as song of discord except that affected creatures automatically attack the nearest target each round. In addition, all affected creatures gain a +4 morale bonus to Strength for the duration of the spell. A creature that succeeds at the Will save reduces the effect’s duration to 1 round.",
